flowchart LR
    D[Approved product, data, payment and channel facts] --> C[Launch-country counsel drafting and review]
    C --> R[Controlled document register and immutable versions]
    R --> P[Product placement: signup, service, booking, payment, message, call]
    P --> U[Plain-language notice, contract or specific choice]
    U --> E[Minimal acceptance, presentation or withdrawal evidence]
    E --> A[Audit, rights, dispute and support processes]
    A --> X{Material product, law, vendor or purpose change?}
    X -- No --> M[Scheduled review and runtime verification]
    X -- Yes --> D
    M --> X

